= Memorandum

#set par(justify: false, spacing: .8em)
#grid(columns: (4.6em, 1fr), row-gutter: 5pt,
  [*To*], [Hallowell County Board of Commissioners],
  [*From*], [Broadband Planning Team],
  [*Subject*], [Preserve the grant now and prepare a conditional open-access award],
  [*Date*], [November 20, 2026],
)
#v(8pt)

#set par(justify: true, spacing: .8em)

*Decision requested.* Hold construction funds. Seek written authority to judge eligibility
block by block and prepare conditional open-access and cooperative offers. All six townships
contain a served flag. Correcting every disputed northern satellite block would leave four
flags in North Ridge and release no construction funds under the township rule.

*What can proceed.* Block reform would admit 47 originally unserved blocks immediately.
Authorize a \$12,585.12 audit of disputed addresses from a separate administrative account
if available. If the audit must share the infrastructure budget, reserve its cost and rerun
the allocations. Report preliminary findings within 90 days and update disputed map entries
after formal decisions. The full verification scenario adds 1,464 northern opportunities and
displaces 479 elsewhere under the partnership, a countywide gain of 985.

*What the grant buys.* At the planning budget of \$11 million, with a 25% township floor,
the county partnership adds #value("ppp_hh") qualifying household opportunities at a ten-year cost of
#value("ppp_cost"), compared with #value("coop_hh") under a sole cooperative award and
#value("tender_hh") under competitive tender. In the partnership's base portfolio the cable
and wireless operators offer service to 3,760 and 1,005 households. The cooperative may also
bid on the same terms. A sole award gives the cooperative the whole portfolio and the cable
provider no construction grant. Residents would have #value("advantage") fewer opportunities
under that alternative. Track actual installation, price and use for work or school separately.

*Who pays.* The county funds four hubs and carries the risk of vacancy and future upkeep.
Seven modeled leases return #value("ppp_rent") in present value, #value("om_recovery") of hub
maintenance and 11.51% of hub construction plus maintenance. Budget for hub capital and the
remaining \$44,981 of discounted upkeep; confirm tenant commitments before releasing funds.

*When to select the cooperative.* With three extra miles on every hub lateral, the modeled
partnership falls to #rows("route_stress").at(3).at(1) opportunities against the cooperative's #value("coop_hh").
The assumed detour illustrates why surveyed routes matter. Within 90 days, request comparable
quotes from the cooperative, the cable provider and the wireless entrant; survey hub routes,
capacity and wireless serviceability; and publish common lease terms. Reoptimize with
verified routes, quotes and signed lease commitments. Award the feasible option offering the
most households qualifying service at the same budget and floor, using lower cost to break a
tie. If block eligibility is denied, retain the construction funds.
